'''R5-G9'''<ref name="Databank">{{Databank|r5-g9|R5-G9}}</ref> was an [[astromech droid]] belonging to [[Griff Halloran]] of [[Ace Squadron]].<ref name="The High Tower" /> Like Halloran's [[Starship|ship]], the ''[[Black Ace]]'', R5-G9 was cobbled together from old [[Galactic Empire|Imperial]]-issue [[droid]]s and other assorted parts, including an old [[R2-series astromech droid|R2 unit]].<ref name="Databank" />

